ternet site (http://www.sec.gov) that contains reports, proxy and information statements, and other information regarding issuers that file electronically with the SEC.","zh":"在我們以電子方式向 SEC 提交或提供此類資料後，可盡快透過我們網站 (www.criver.com) 的投資者關係部分免費取得此 10-K 表格以及向 SEC 提交的所有其他報告。 SEC 維護一個網站 (http://www.sec.gov)，其中包含以電子方式向 SEC 提交的報告、委託書和資訊聲明以及有關發行人的其他資訊。"},{"en":"We are a leading, full service, non-clinical global drug development partner with a mission to create healthier lives. We have built upon our original core competency of laboratory animal medicine and science (research model technologies) to develop a diverse portfolio of discovery and safety assessment services, both Good Laboratory Practice (GLP) and non-GLP, that supports our clients from target identification through non-clinical development. We also provide a suite of products and services to support our clients' manufacturing activities. Utilizing our broad portfolio of products and services enables our clients to create a more efficient and flexible drug development model, which reduces their costs, enhances their productivity and effectiveness, and increases speed to market.","zh":"我們是領先的全方位服務非臨床全球藥物開發合作夥伴，其使命是創造更健康的生活。我們以實驗動物醫學和科學（研究模型技術）的原始核心能力為基礎，開發了多樣化的發現和安全評估服務組合，包括良好實驗室規範 (GLP) 和非 GLP，為我們的客戶提供從目標識別到非臨床開發的支援。我們也提供一套產品和服務來支援客戶的製造活動。利用我們廣泛的產品和服務組合，我們的客戶能夠創建更有效率、更靈活的藥物開發模式，從而降低成本、提高生產力和有效性，並加快上市速度。"},{"en":"The development of new drugs requires a steadily increasing investment of time and money. Various studies and reports estimate that it takes between 10 to 15 years, up to $2.6 billion excluding time costs and exploration of between 10,000 and 15,000 drug molecules to produce a single Food and Drug Administration (FDA)-approved drug.","zh":"新藥的開發需要不斷增加時間和金錢的投入。各種研究和報告估計，生產一種美國食品和藥物管理局 (FDA) 批准的藥物需要 10 到 15 年的時間，不包括時間成本和探索 10,000 到 15,000 個藥物分子，費用高達 26 億美元。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Our goal is to be a leader in each of the markets in which we participate. We compete in the marketplace based on our therapeutic and scientific expertise in early-stage drug research, quality, reputation, flexibility, responsiveness, pricing, innovation and global capabilities. We offer a unique portfolio of early-stage products and services to support drug discovery and development.","zh":"我們的目標是成為我們參與的每個市場的領導者。我們憑藉在早期藥物研究、品質、聲譽、靈活性、回應能力、定價、創新和全球能力方面的治療和科學專業知識在市場上競爭。我們提供獨特的早期產品和服務組合來支持藥物發現和開發。"},{"en":"We encounter a broad range of competitors of different sizes and capabilities in each of our three business segments. We also face competition from the internal discovery and development resources of our clients.","zh":"我們在三個業務領域都遇到了各種不同規模和能力的競爭對手。我們也面臨來自客戶內部發現和開發資源的競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-27","items":[{"name":"Discovery & Safety Assessment","val":2402891000,"zh":"發現與安全評估部門"},{"name":"Research Models & Services","val":846082000,"zh":"研究模式與服務部門"},{"name":"Manufacturing Support","val":766409000,"zh":"製造支援部門"}],"total":4015382000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-27","items":[{"name":"Service","val":3250099000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Product","val":765283000,"zh":"產品"}],"total":4015382000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-27","items":[{"name":"US","val":2141773000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":1102696000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"CA","val":501025000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":205023000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other","val":64865000,"zh":"其他"}],"total":4015382000}},"peers":["TECH","IQV","COO","BIO","WST"]}}